## Testing

Run the A4 test suite:
```bash
python -m pytest tests/test_trial_count_validation.py -v
```

Tests verify:
1. All 12 conditions detected
2. Family/omission position mappings correct
3. Matched controls correctly assigned
4. Trial counts extracted from shapes
5. Session completeness identified
6. Truth status preserved

Current Status: **10/10 tests PASS**

