| `context/specs/task-specification.md` | Task definition reference |

## Important Notes

- **Do Not**: Read full neural array payloads (violates A4 contract)
- **Do Not**: Generate figures or biological claims
- **Do Not**: Create canonical real data manifests yet
- **Do Preserve**: SPK/LFP separation, condition family structure, omission position mapping
- **Do Track**: Truth status and metadata completeness

